```ts
export function filterByTags(bookmarks: Bookmark[], tags: string[]): Bookmark[] {
  return bookmarks.filter((b) => tags.every((tag) => b.tags.includes(tag)));
}
```

It uses `tags.every(...)` over the bookmark's tag list, giving strict AND semantics — including the empty-array case, where `every` is vacuously true and all bookmarks pass through unchanged. Matches the existing `findByTag` style.

